{"ID":"20240902161703-13fefsl","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240902161703-13fefsl","title":"八角茴香（大茴香）","type":"doc","updated":"20240902162053"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240902161732-shh6yd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902161732-shh6yd6","updated":"20240902161732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产广西、云南等地。\n【性状】\t聚合果约由8个 (稀513个) 蓇葖果聚成，各分果近等大，放射状排列于中轴上，蓇葖果长12cm，高0.51cm，外表面棕褐色或红褐色，有不规则皱纹，顶端钝或钝尖，果皮较厚，上侧多开裂成小艇形；内表面淡棕色，有光泽。每个蓇葖果含种子1粒，扁卵圆形，红棕色或灰棕色，有光泽。果梗长34cm，弯曲，常脱落。气芳香，味辛、甜。\n【性味】\t辛，温。\n【功效】\t散寒；理气；止痛。用治寒疝腹痛；腰膝冷痛；胃寒呕吐；脘腹疼痛；寒湿脚气。\n【注解】\t“蓇葖果”：指由单心皮或离生心皮单雌蕊发育而成的果实，成熟后沿腹缝线一侧开裂。"}]},{"ID":"20240902161732-pc0801u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902161732-pc0801u","updated":"20240902161732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206094100-ar5xlas.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240902161732-rkfx5yr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902161732-rkfx5yr","updated":"20240902161732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 509px;","style":"width: 499px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"八角茴香 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/八角茴香 2-20240724110145-89e1si4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 499px;\" parent-style=\"width: 509px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240902161732-kphli6d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902161732-kphli6d","updated":"20240902161732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties